# Fetched from the app when a workflow runs, never committed. See the workflows.
#
# The app is the one place the rules live. A copy kept here would be a second
# definition of what the directory accepts, and the two would disagree the first
# time either was edited.
scripts/directory.js
scripts/linkhealth.js

# health.json is deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# It is the link checker's memory: which packs failed, on which days, and how
# many times running. Unlisting takes three failures on three separate days, so
# a run that cannot read what the last run wrote can never reach three and no
# dead link is ever cleared. It was ignored here once, which also broke the
# workflow outright, because `git add` on an ignored path fails rather than
# quietly skipping it.
